From 6901afe95947f95f503703c42f0752d6130f480e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.local>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 20:02:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(books): tolerate learning-tab name variants and stop
 silent fallthrough to 'unknown command'
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Normalize tab titles (NFKC, strip diacritics/tatweel, fold alef/hamza, collapse spaces)
  and discover learning tabs tolerantly so a trailing space/diacritic no longer yields
  zero books.
- live_books: catch structured-extraction errors and still run the proven search
  fallback; log a diagnostic '[books_context] live_books -> N book(s) (..)'.
- Telegram: explicit /books now replies with the real reason instead of falling through
  to 'أمر غير معروف'; register 'books' in the command list (setMyCommands).
- Tests: 4 new regression tests; full suite 164 passed.
